x_comment('x_CincinattiMeat-packingAssemblyLine',"The modern industrial assembly line derived from the meat-packing industry, where hogs were butchered and transported from station to station by overhead rail.  This preceeded Taylor's scientific management by 40 years.\nThe assembly line is an example of figure-ground reversal because it flipped the relation beween the worker and the work.  The human became part of the machine, with specialized divisions of labor, and the work flowed through it.") :- x_cid(a65b125fff803b).
