x_comment(x_GutenbergPrintingPress,"The printing press with metal movable type was more an improvement in flexibility than simple efficiency.  By dividing the unit of reusable type to the letter, the press became more flexible, useful for printing many different things.  Xylography was an efficient, but inflexible, precursor.\nThe press also needed to apply greater pressures.  It employed a screw press previously used for binding books.") :- x_cid(a65b125fff8d85).
