x_comment(x_KohlrauschsLaw,"Aka Debye-Huckel eqn or Onsanger's conductance theory.\nEstablishes the limiting equivalent conductance of an electrolyte as the sum of the independent migrations of anions and cations.\nImportant in processes involving batteries or plating solutions.\n\"If a salt is dissolved in water, the conductivity of the solution is the sum of two values -- one depending on the positive ions and the other on the negative ions. \"\nKohlrausch, F.; Grotrian, O., Ann. Physik 1875, 154 , 1\nKohlrausch, F., Ann. Physik 1880, 11 , 653") :- x_cid(a65b125fff92f8).
