x_comment(x_LawOfTheLever,"The Law of the Lever states the inverse proportionality of the weights and the lever arm lengths.  First known statement of this law (in qualitative terms) is in the Aristotelian treatise \"Mechanical Problems\", probably by Stato.\nLater treated mathematically in Euclid's \"Treatise on the Balance\" and Archimedes' On the Equilibrium of Planes\"\nArchimedes was the first to apply formal quantitative analysis to the problem of equilbrium, connecting numbers to continuous physical quantities.") :- x_cid(a65b125fff93e6).
