x_comment(x_SparkChamber,"Origin not clear, used for detecting gamma or cosmic rays.  Similar to a combination of a geiger counter and cloud chamber, a spark chamber is a sequence of conducting plates at progressively higher potentials.  Unlike a solid-state detector which converts photons directly to electrons, the spark chamber detects the visual spark when a gamma ray knocks an electron off the plate, causing an arc between plates.") :- x_cid(a65b125fffa60c).
