x_comment(x_SparkPlug,"Igniting a cylinder with an electric spark is a lot more reliable than igniting via temperature alone.\nThe spark is achieved through self-induction - the rapid breaking of a voltage passing through an inductive coil causes the voltage to spike and a spark discharge.\nBosch's spark plug depended on his prior improvement of the magneto.") :- x_cid(a65b125fffa614).
xc_microtheory(a65b125fffa614,x_MetaengineeringInnovationsMt).
