x_comment(x_Titration,"The strategy of titration might be better thought of as progressive dilution to achieve cancellation.\nTitration is the addition of a solution from a graduated container (eg, a burette) to a known volume of a second solution, until the chamical reaction between the two is just completed.  Knowing the volume of the solution added and the strength of one of the solutions allows one to infer the strength of the other.") :- x_cid(a65b125fffaa5c).
