x_comment(x_Turbosupercharger,"Commonly shortened to \"turbocharger\", this is a supercharger driven by a turbine (as opposed to a centrifugal supercharger)\nBüchi's turbocharger both pre-compressed the air flowing into the engine, and used the kinetic energy coming out in the exhaust gas under high pressure, which otherwise was simply wasted.  The exhaust gas flowing out after the combustion process  drove a turbine which in turn drove a compressor pre-compressing the intake air and boosting the air charge in the engine. \nGerman patent of 16 Nov 1905.\nFirst applied in large marine engines.") :- x_cid(a65b125fffab88).
xc_microtheory(a65b125fffab88,x_MetaengineeringInnovationsMt).
