x_comment('x_Turbosupercharger-Aircraft',"consists of a turbine that takes energy from the exhaust of an internal combustion engine, and a compressor driven by that turbine that compreses air going into the engine.\nEnables airplanes to fly higher, in thinner air than would otherwise sustain engine power.\nAlthough the concept of the turbosupercharger was originally due to Büchi and Rateau, it's practical development was overseen largely by Stanford Moss at G.E.") :- x_cid(a65b125fffab8f).
